<title>CANADA: Molson's Beaver Lumber unit names new president.</title>
<headline>Molson's Beaver Lumber unit names new president.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Beaver Lumber Co Ltd said on Wednesday that Douglas Robinson has been appointed president and chief operating officer of the company.</p>
<p>Beaver Lumber, a unit of Molson Cos Ltd, said the appointment will take effect November 30.</p>
<p>Robinson, who has been vice-president of operations for the past two years, will succeed Ralph Trott who resigned to pursue other opportunities, the firm said in a statement.</p>
<p>	  -- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
